{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15906","headline":"邯郸主人 · 王建","name":"邯郸主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远客无主人，夜投邯郸市。\n飞蛾绕残烛，半夜人醉起。\n垆边酒家女，遗我缃绮被。\n合成双凤花，宛转不相离。\n纵令颜色改，勿遣合欢异。\n一念始爲难，万金谁足贵。\n门前长安道，去者如流水。\n晨风羣鸟翔，裴回别离此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}